nvcurve-gui
Copyright (C) 2026 arabcian

Extracted from Centurion (https://github.com/arabcian/centurion): the nvcurve
crate, the NVIDIA Curve tab, the Vulkan GPU stress test and its GUI, the
privileged-helper runner, the theme system, the polkit actions/rules and the boot guard.

Multi-GPU support follows LACT (https://github.com/ilya-zlobintsev/LACT,
lact-daemon/src/server/gpu_controller/nvidia*): each NVML device is matched to
its NvAPI physical GPU handle by PCI bus number (NvAPI_GPU_GetBusId), and NVML
devices are opened by PCI bus id. LACT is distributed under the MIT License:

